+## PowerShell Cheat Sheet
+
+### Common Commands
+
+```powershell
+# Set environment variable (temporary - for current session only)
+$env:SCRAPER_SECRET_KEY = "your-secret-key"
+
+# Use it in requests
+$key = $env:SCRAPER_SECRET_KEY
+$url = "https://yourapp.railway.app/api/scrape/midnight?key=$key"
+
+# Make HTTP POST request
+Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $url -Method Post
+
+# Make HTTP GET request
+Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $url -Method Get
+
+# Parse JSON response
+$response = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $url -Method Post
+$response.summary.totalEventsScraped
+
+# Format JSON output nicely
+$response | ConvertTo-Json -Depth 10 | Write-Host
+
+# Check if command exists
+Get-Command curl
+Get-Command railway
+Get-Command git
+```
+
+### Quick Setup Script
+
+Save this as `setup-scraper.ps1`:
+
+```powershell
+# Setup Midnight Scraper for Dublin Events App
+
+Write-Host "🚀 Dublin Events - Scraper Setup" -ForegroundColor Cyan
+Write-Host "================================" -ForegroundColor Cyan
+
+# 1. Get secret key from user
+$secretKey = Read-Host "Enter SCRAPER_SECRET_KEY (or press Enter for default)"
+if (-not $secretKey) {
+    $secretKey = "dev-scraper-key"
+}
+
+# 2. Test local scraper
+Write-Host "`nTesting local scraper..." -ForegroundColor Yellow
+try {
+    $localUrl = "http://localhost:3000/api/scrape/midnight?key=$secretKey"
+    $localResponse = Invoke-RestMethod -Uri $localUrl -Method Post -TimeoutSec 30
+    
+    Write-Host "✅ Local scraper working!" -ForegroundColor Green
+    Write-Host "Events found: $($localResponse.summary.totalEventsScraped)" -ForegroundColor Green
+    
+} catch {
+    Write-Host "⚠️ Local server not running. Make sure 'npm run dev' is active." -ForegroundColor Yellow
+}
+
+# 3. Instructions for Railway
+Write-Host "`n📝 Next Steps:" -ForegroundColor Cyan
+Write-Host "1. Go to railway.app and set SCRAPER_SECRET_KEY=$secretKey"
+Write-Host "2. Go to easycron.com and create cron job:"
+Write-Host "   URL: https://yourapp.railway.app/api/scrape/midnight?key=$secretKey"
+Write-Host "   Cron: 0 0 * * *"
+Write-Host "3. Or use GitHub Actions for scheduling"
+Write-Host "4. Deploy: git push origin main"
+
+Write-Host "`n✨ Setup complete!" -ForegroundColor Green
+```
+
+Run it:
+```powershell
+.\setup-scraper.ps1
+```
